{"id":"erinnerung","lemma":"Erinnerung","pos":"noun","rank":1276,"glosses":["memory (recall); remembrance","reminder, something that reminds","memento, the objects wherewith the memory is supported"],"ipa":"/ɛɐˈʔɪnəʁʊŋ(k)/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/3f/De-Erinnerung.ogg/De-Erinnerung.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Erinnerung","plural":"Erinnerungen"},"formAudio":{"Erinnerungen":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/49/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Erinnerungen.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Danke für die Erinnerungen.","en":"Thanks for the memories.","words":[{"g":"thanks, thank you"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Ich brauche keine Erinnerung.","en":"I don't need reminding.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to need","l":"brauchen"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},null]},{"text":"Das Bild brachte viele Erinnerungen zurück.","en":"The picture brought back a lot of memories.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"digital photograph"},{"g":"brought"},{"g":"much, a lot","l":"viel"},null,{"g":"stand back!"}]},{"text":"Ich behalte dich in guter Erinnerung.","en":"I have fond memories of you.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to keep, to retain","l":"behalten"},{"g":"you","l":"du"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"good","l":"gut"},null]},{"text":"Erinnerungen verblassen zu schnell.","en":"Memories fade too quickly.","words":[null,{"g":"to fade"},{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"quickly"}]}]}